   "memberId": "N000002",
   "network": "bluesky",
   "postedAt": "2026-11-17T17:38:03.767Z",
   "text": "American children are now at serious risk from a preventable disease due to RFK Jr. and the \"MAHA\" agenda sabotaging our nation's most critical public health and science programs. Let me be clear: vaccines are safe and effective.",
