   "memberId": "S000148",
   "network": "bluesky",
   "postedAt": "2026-11-17T17:18:52.206Z",
   "text": "Instead of focusing on strengthening our bonds in Southeast Asia and countering China, Trump is treating the ASEAN conference in the Philippines as little more than a layover on his way to meet with Xi Jinping, Vladimir Putin, and potentially even Kim Jong Un.",
