   "memberId": "S000148",
   "network": "bluesky",
   "postedAt": "2026-11-16T23:06:19.419Z",
   "text": "Since it wasn't enough to kick millions off their health insurance, Trump and RFK Jr. have allowed thousands to fall ill and even die by letting vaccine-preventable disease spread.\n\nThey will answer to Congress and the American people about how and why they let this happen.",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/schumer.senate.gov/post/3n2hndq6af22j",
