   "memberId": "S000148",
   "network": "bluesky",
   "postedAt": "2026-11-16T22:01:27.090Z",
   "text": "Grocery prices are higher than ever. Trump's response?\n \nKick another 6 million off of food stamps and stop nearly 2 million kids from getting free school lunches.",
