  },
  {
   "id": "bluesky:at://did:plc:lawfan5jdv75zng4kwjyfzey/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2gxbsdo2k2c",
   "memberId": "N000002",
   "network": "bluesky",
   "postedAt": "2026-11-16T16:31:32.266Z",
   "text": "Congress has already allocated $12.5 billion to repair our nation's aging air traffic control system. Yet Secretary Duffy and the Trump Administration have only spent a fraction of this investment and are blaming a router instead of taking accountability for this monumental failure. (1/2)",
