   "postedAt": "2026-11-13T20:34:46.908Z",
   "text": "With Democrats in control of both chambers of Congress next year, we have the chance to address the growing dangers of AI. The Trump administration is attempting to empower greedy AI corporations to steal from authors, artists, and creators in the guise of \u201cnational security.\u201d",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/nadler.house.gov/post/3n27thyij5s2m",
